@startuml
title State diagram for the Online Quiz System

state "Unregistered" as Unregistered
state "Logged In - Student" as LoggedInStudent
state "Logged In - Teacher" as LoggedInTeacher
state "Quiz Not Started" as QuizNotStarted
state "Answering Quiz" as AnsweringQuiz
state "Submitted Quiz" as SubmittedQuiz
state "Viewing Results" as ViewingResults

[*] --> Unregistered : Register or Login

Unregistered --> LoggedInStudent : Login - Student
Unregistered --> LoggedInTeacher : Login - Teacher

LoggedInTeacher : entry/Logged In - Teacher
LoggedInTeacher : do/Create New Quiz
LoggedInTeacher : do/Edit Existing Quiz
LoggedInTeacher : do/Save as Draft
LoggedInTeacher : do/Post for Students
LoggedInTeacher : exit/View Results

LoggedInStudent : entry/Logged In - Student
LoggedInStudent : do/Select Quiz
LoggedInStudent : do/Answer Quiz
LoggedInStudent : do/Submit Quiz
LoggedInStudent : exit/View Result

QuizNotStarted --> AnsweringQuiz : Select and Start Quiz
AnsweringQuiz --> SubmittedQuiz : Submit Quiz
SubmittedQuiz --> ViewingResults : View Results

state "Logged Out" as LoggedOut <<final>>
state "Quiz Created" as QuizCreated
state "Quiz Edited" as QuizEdited
state "Quiz Draft Saved" as QuizDraftSaved
state "Quiz Posted" as QuizPosted
state "Result Viewed" as ResultViewed

LoggedInTeacher --> QuizCreated : Create New Quiz
QuizCreated --> QuizEdited : Edit Existing Quiz
QuizEdited --> QuizDraftSaved : Save as Draft
QuizDraftSaved --> QuizPosted : Post for Students
QuizPosted --> ViewingResults : View Results

AnsweringQuiz --> LoggedOut : Logout
SubmittedQuiz --> LoggedOut : Logout
ViewingResults --> LoggedOut : Logout

@enduml
